# /act scratch artifacts — these are written by `scripts/act/reply-threads.sh --file`
# at the worktree root and the pre-commit `nx format:write --uncommitted` step will
# re-stage them after `git restore --staged`. Either `rm` before commit or pass an
# absolute path outside the worktree (e.g. `/tmp/agent_*/replies.tsv`).
/replies.tsv
/replies-new.tsv
/replies-update.tsv
/reply-update.tsv
